 **Edge Cases and Pitfalls:**
-*   **Precision:** Not given in the sources.
-*   **Boundaries:** Index parity sharding avoids cross-block visibility waste, but requires careful handling of Gaussian visibility across tile boundaries during the all-to-all exchange [S1, unofficial].
